  "title": "Double Coco Double Chocolate Chip Cookies (a twist on Toll House® cookies)",
  "description": "The classic Toll House® cookie recipe gets an extra chocolatey twist with the addition of cocoa powder to the batter creating decadent cookies the whole family will love.",
  "authors": [
    "coxbrea151"
  ],
